OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor narrowly escapes
OL,4,A'scary' house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor who narrowly escaped a
OL,7,Fhouse fire has spoken about her "very
OL,8,Fscary" experience and urged others to
OL,9,Fensure they have a plan in place if it
OL,10,Fhappens to them.
OL,12,FMel Fordington, of Worcestershire
OL,13,FCounty Council, was woken by the fire
OL,14,Falarm after a blaze broke out in the
OL,15,Fliving room of her home just outside
OL,16,FHallow, at about 04:00 GMT on Tuesday.
OL,18,FShe and her husband Carl managed to
OL,19,Ffind their way out of the property,
OL,20,Fthrough thick black smoke, before the
OL,21,Ffire service arrived and extinguished
OL,22,Fthe blaze.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
