OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor narrowly escapes
OL,4,A'scary' house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Hallow representative said she
OL,7,Ffirst thought it was a car alarm
OL,8,Fsounding before she went downstairs and
OL,9,Fcould "feel the heat" through the
OL,10,Fliving room door.
